# Trained RF-DETR checkpoints. 127 MB each, over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit,
# so unlike the small pretrained weights these are not committed. They are not
# published either, so copy them in by hand (see ai_models/README.md).
ai_models/fire_smoke_rfdetr/*.pth
ai_models/fire_smoke_RFDETR/*.pth
